        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar “preparation area,” surrounded by strangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment, the system’s voice rings in your ears—“New mission, commencing immediately.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission after mission, life and death hang in the balance. Some return safely, while others remain lost at the end of the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by accumulating points can you reclaim your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure with no retreat. All you can do is keep moving forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 80,000-word mid-length story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear narrative—A no-choice visual novel that delivers a tightly woven and gripping narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied mission settings, From mystery to horror, and into the realm of the bizarre, the atmosphere constantly shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional storytelling focused on bonds, survival, and character growth</p></li></ul>",
